# =============================================================================
# Worker env bundle for muaddib self-hosting.
# Copy to `.muaddib/secrets.env` (gitignored) — spawn-worker.sh reads it directly.
#
# This is genuinely near-empty right now, not under-filled-in:
#  - CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN / GITHUB_TOKEN come from your shell env, not this
#    file (spawn-worker.sh reads them directly and fails loudly if unset).
#  - muaddib itself has no config.ts-style required env vars, no DB, and no
#    third-party service integrations of its own to configure here.
#  - LINEAR_API_KEY is deliberately NOT listed — muaddib's own tickets live in
#    GitHub Issues (rphovley/muaddib), never Linear. Do not add a Linear key
#    here to work around the missing GitHub-Issues ticket-fetch path; that's
#    being scoped separately.
# =============================================================================

# TODO (blocked on the GitHub-Issues ticket-fetch scoping, tracked separately):
# whatever token that path ends up needing (likely a GitHub PAT with `issues`
# scope, separate from the repo-scoped GITHUB_TOKEN spawn-worker.sh already
# requires for branch pushes/PRs) goes here once that design lands.
